Package: com.qcom-toolbox.no-sep-bootloop-rootless
Name: No SEP Bootloop (Rootless)
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Removes the Face ID & Passcode / Touch ID & Passcode settings entry entirely and blocks any passcode/biometric enrollment screen, to avoid SEP/AP desync bootloops on jailbroken devices. Rootless build — for Dopamine and palera1n rootless mode.
Maintainer: qcom-toolbox
Author: qcom-toolbox
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 12.0)
Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qcom-toolbox/No-SEP-Bootloop/main/ICON.png
